ing over **9,000\nretail locations** nationwide—our dedication to quality and service positions us as an industry\nleader in the IT ecosystem.\n\nSupertron India’s success comes from our commitment to delivering the latest in the IT and telecom\nindustry while ensuring operational efficiency for our partners. We are constantly innovating,\nproviding businesses with relevant tools, and the support they need to survive in this rapidly\nevolving technological landscape.\n\n[ Read More ][47]\n\n#### Key Milestones in Our Growth Journey:\n* Achieved ₹8,500 Crs in Turnover (2025-26)\n* Acquired D2C Consumer Wearable Brand ‘Leaf Studios’\n* 30+ Years of Industry Leadership\n* Partnerships with 50+ Global Brands\n* Serving 9,000+ Retail Locations Across India\n* Delivering to All Major IT Hubs Nationwide\n\n## Our Offerings\n\nDiscover Our Expertise: Comprehensive IT Distribution and Value-Added Services Across India\nSupertron India is dedicated to delivering cutting-edge technology solutions across the nation. Our\nofferings are specifically tailored to meet the diverse needs of your businesses, ensuring you have\naccess to the best products and services available.\n* [ IT ][48]\n* [ Value Added Distribution ][49]\n\nAs a leading distributor of IT products in India, Supertron India provides a wide array of hardware,\nsoftware, and networking solutions. Our established relationships with global IT manufacturers allow\nus to bring the latest innovations to businesses across the country.\n\n[ Read More ][50]\n\nOur Value-Added Distribution services help businesses implement comprehensive IT solutions that go\nbeyond product supply. We assist in system integration, deployment, and continuous support to ensure\nbusinesses optimise their IT infrastructure.\n\n[ Read More ][51]\n\n### 34 Branch Offices\n\n### 17 Satellite Offices\n\n### 60 Warehouses\n\n### 650 Employees\n\n### 29 States of presence in India\n\n## Partners\n\n## Our Verticals\n\n[][52]\n\n#### Supertron Infotech\n\n[][53]\n\n#### [ Supertron Infotech ][54]\n\n\nSupertron Infotech Trading LLC, headquartered in Dubai, UAE, is a leading force in the region’s\ndigital transformation landscape. As a dynamic division of Supertron, we deliver cutting-edge cloud\nand SaaS solutions, empowering businesses with the technology they need to achieve operational\nexcellence and competitive advantage.\n\nWe collaborate with industry titans like Zoho, Dropbox, DocuSign and Sophos, to provide\ncomprehensive cloud services, security products, and SaaS technology. Our expertise ensures\nbusinesses have access to scalable and secure cloud infrastructure, enabling them to navigate their\ndigital journeys with confidence.\n\nThe strategic location of Dubai allows us to effectively cater to Europe, Middle East, and Africa\n(EMEA) market, ensuring our clients receive the highest level of service and support. With our\ncommitment to innovation and excellence, Supertron Infotech continues to be a trusted partner in\ndigital transformation, helping organisations achieve their technological goals and thrive in an\nincreasingly digital world.\n\n[][55]\n\n#### Prointek Global (Solitaire IFPD)\n\n[][56]\n\n#### [ Prointek Global (Solitaire IFPD) ][57]\n\n\nBrand Solitaire, a distinguished brand owned by Supertron Electronics, is on a mission to reshape\nthe landscape of information sharing and absorption. With a robust portfolio of interactive flat\npanels, accessories, and unified communication products, Solitaire is revolutionising both\nin-classroom and remote learning environment, as well as enhancing meeting room productivity. As a\npioneering force in interactive technology, Solitaire distinguishes itself as an industry disruptor,\nserving both the education sector (with a focus on private schools, government schools, GeM\nbusiness, and large- scale ICT and smart classroom projects) and the business sector (with a focus\non SMEs and SMBs).\n\nManufactured at Prointek Global Innovations Pvt. Ltd. (PGIPL) in Noida, a subsidiary of Supertron\nElectronics, Solitaire products exemplify innovation and cutting-edge technology products. PGIPL\nspecialises in designing and creating high-quality teaching products that improve learning outcomes\nand meeting room productivity. PGIPL’s ability to conceptualise, design, and manufacture innovative\ntech products uniquely tailored to the needs of its Education & Enterprise customers sets them\napart.\n\n[][58]\n\n#### Leaf (Consumer Product Brand)\n\n[][59]\n\n#### [ Leaf (Consumer Product Brand) ][60]\n\n\nLeaf Studios, a renowned homegrown audio brand, has become a pivotal addition to the Supertron\nfamily. Known for its innovative and high-quality hearable and wearable products, Leaf Studios\nenhances user experiences by seamlessly blending advanced technology, functionality, and style.\nSince its inception, Leaf has focused on creating high-quality hearable and wearable products that\ncater to the needs of modern consumers. Our product range includes earbuds, neckbands, over-ear\nheadphones, and smartwatches, all designed to provide an immersive and enjoyable user experience.\n\nWith a strong emphasis on combining technology and style, Leaf products stand out for their\nexceptional sound quality, user-friendly features, and sleek design. The integration of our patented\nAI-powered personalised sound technology further enhances the audio experience, ensuring that every\nproduct delivers unmatched performance and satisfaction.\n\nSupertron Foundation\n\n## Empowering Underprivileged Communities Through Meaningful CSR Initiatives\n\n##### Our Key Focus Areas Include:\n* **Health**: Improving access to healthcare and medical support.\n* **Disability**: Offering assistance and opportunities for people with disabilities.\n* **Education**: Facilitating educational programs and scholarships.\n* **Skill Development**: Promoting skill-building and vocational training to enhance employment\n  opportunities.\n\nSupertron Foundation’s objective is simple – to fulfill our obligations to the community and\nenvironment, creating a lasting positive impact through strategic CSR efforts.\n\n[ Read More ][61]\n\n## What Our Client Says\n\nHaving a computer was a luxury for most people when Supertron first began operating.\n* Let’s Talk\n* [ Contact Us ][62]\n\nWe’ve been associated with Superton for nearly 16 years, and their team continues to impress. They\nare highly motivated and always provide strong support to partners like us. It's been a great\nexperience working with them!\n\n#### Amrish Puri\n\nBhagwat Computronics, New Delhi\n\n[ ][63]\n\nDoing business with Supertron there are three ease. Ease of doing business, and second is interstate\nsupport which they give us and enriching relationships. I hope that the journey continues and we\ngrow together.\n\n#### Rahul Zaveri\n\nApex Enterprises, Mumbai\n\n[ ][64]\n\nWe’ve been associated with Supertron for over two decades. Our relationship goes beyond just being\nchannel partners; it's built on mutual trust and continuous guidance, which has been instrumental in\nhelping us grow and succeed together.\n\n#### N. Dhanuka\n\nGalaxy Computech, Kolkata\n\n[ ][65]\n\nSupertron and Seagate relationship is almost a decade old in India. I think both the teams have done\na great job working together and growing the Seagate brand in India. We look forward for the\nassociation to continue for a long term.\n\n#### Sameer Bhatia\n\nCountry Manager, India & SAARC, Seagate Technology\n\n[ ][66]\n\nWe have a very good relationship with Supertron and I think it's a great organisation. We work very\nclosely with them. Our sales team & their sales team work together and we achieved the desired\nresults. With the coming years Samsung & Superton will do wonders in the marketplace.\n\n#### Puneet Sethi\n\nVice President, CE Division, Samsung India\n\n[ ][67]\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nWe’d love to hear from you! If you have any questions, comments, or feedback, feel free