[279] [English][280]\n[ [Flag_of_Hong_Kong] ][281]\n[ Hong Kong (Distribution) ][282] [English][283]\n[ [Flag_of_Indonesia] ][284]\n[ Indonesia ][285] [English][286]\n[ [icon_flag_india] ][287]\n[ India ][288] [English][289]\n[ [Japan] ][290]\n[ Japan ][291] [English][292] | [Japanese][293]\n[ [Flag_of_Malaysia] ][294]\n[ Malaysia ][295] [English][296]\n[ [New Zealand] ][297]\n[ New Zealand ][298] [English][299]\n[ [Flag_of_Singapore] ][300]\n[ Singapore ][301] [English][302]\n[ [Flag_of_Thailand] ][303]\n[ Thailand ][304] [English][305]\n[ [Flag_of_Vietnam] ][306]\n[ Vietnam ][307] [English][308]\n[English][309] | [Indonesian][310] | [Indonesian][311] | [English][312] | [Sango][313] |\n[English][314]\n\n## Achieving\n## great outcomes\n## with technology\n\n#### Unlock your potential\n#### with Tech Data\n\n[icon]\nContact us\n[ Become a Partner ][315]\n[icon]\nBecome a vendor\n[ Get started today ][316]\n[ Download the 2025 Direction of Technology Report ][317]\n\n# **Unlocking potential**\n\n## Tech Data empowers IT innovators, ecosystem partners and technology talent to achieve great\n## outcomes\n\nTechnology moves fast. We partner with the entire technology ecosystem to manage relentless\ntransformation, execute confidently, and evolve to capture opportunities up ahead. \n\n## Evolving in a vibrant, interconnected world\n\nThere’s more that connects us than divides us. The technology partner ecosystem is alive with\nconnections that inspire innovation, creative solutions and partnerships that enrich the way we live\nand work. Tech Data brings together people who want to achieve great things with technology and\nunlock potential for all. \n\n# Empowering technology partners\n\nTechnology moves fast. We partner with the entire technology ecosystem to manage relentless\ntransformation, execute confidently, and evolve to capture opportunities up ahead.\n\n[technology-solutions]\n\n#### Technology Solutions\n\n[business-services]\n\n#### Business Services\n\n[digital-platforms]\n\n#### Digital Platforms\n\n[technology-solutions]\n\n#### Technology Solutions\n\n[digital-platforms]\n\n#### Digital Platforms\n\n[business-services]\n\n#### Business Services\n\n# Compelling technology solutions\n\nWe’re intent on the success of our partners from edge-to-cloud. Tech Data brings together the most\nwell-known names in IT and emerging technology innovators supported by 23,000 co-workers around the\nworld.\n\n#### Edge Solutions\n* Computing\n* Accesories\n* Display solutions\n* Ergonomic solutions\n* Printing solutions\n\n#### Advanced Solutions\n* Infrastructure\n* Software\n* Networking\n* Hybrid cloud\n* Hyperscale cloud\n* Security\n* Data & AI / Analytics\n\n#### Specialized Solutions\n\n \n* Components\n* Lyfecycle\n* CAD\n* Implementation\n* Professional & Managed Services\n* ISV solutions\n* Education and enablement\n* Marketing\n* AR/VR\n\n# Unlocking potential in a dynamic marketplace\n\nTech Data brings together solutions for every type of ecosystem partner with global technology\ndistribution and solution aggregation capabilities. We simplify the complex so you can maximize\nvalue to your end users.\n\n[dynamic-marketplace]\n\nHow we simplify\n* A library of seamless-to-deploy Click to Run™ Solutions\n* Proven paths to success developed by system engineers and solution architects\n* Personalized support for custom and purpose-built solutions\n\n \n\nHow you benefit\n* Get to market faster\n* Leverage technical expertise and lower costs\n* Create experiences that increase end user satisfaction\n\n# Contributing to the ecosystem of ideas\n\nTech Data sits at the center of the Technology Partner Ecosystem. Our unique position gives us the\nopportunity to lead as a solutions aggregator and an ideas aggregator.\n\n[tech-data-ecosystem-of-ideas]\n\n## Keeping pace with the headlines and insights from the Techology Ecosystem is its own full time\n## job\n\n[blog-evolution-channel-technology]\n\n### [ The Evolution of Channel Technology ][318]\n\n[\n\nMore than ever, there is a tremendous market opportunity to capitalize on additional growth and\nexpand the addressable IT market. But it’s not going to get there with the status quo.\n\n][319]\n[Learn more][320]\n[blog-tech-consumption-models]\n\n### [ What is Driving New Tech Consumption Models? ][321]\n\n[\n\nEven before the pandemic, investment in cloud, security and IoT was on the rise and in the last 18\nmonths, that growth has been exponential.\n\n][322]\n[Learn more][323]\n[blog-discovering-simplicity-i"
